<title>USA: Reuter shares registered with U.S. SEC.</title>
<headline>Reuter shares registered with U.S. SEC.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reuters Holdings Plc filed a shelf registration statement with U.S. regulators for up to 7,589,557 ordinary shares in connection with a Daily Mail &amp; General Trust Plc exchangeable bond offering.</p>
<p>The filing relates to Daily Mail's issuance of bonds that are exchangeable into Reuter shares at any time between Aug 11 and September 21, 2004. The 2.5 percent exchangeable bonds due 2004 were offered for sale on June 5.</p>
<p>Reuters will not receive any proceeds from the exchange.</p>
</text>
